<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise for Second Day, Crude Oil Gains: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税计划面临阻力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video</link><description>贸易伙伴对美国最新关税计划的反应既失望又抗议，但一些贸易伙伴仍抱有谈判的前景。彭博社驻北亚记者 Minmin Low 表示，中国和欧盟已明确表示，如有必要，他们将进行报复。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video'&gt;美国关税计划面临阻力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Plans for Tariffs Face Pushback&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:15:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本 GPIF 将介绍每项资产组合审查，而不仅仅是部分审查</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some</link><description>日本政府养老金投资基金现在向董事会报告其战略资产配置的每次审查结果，而不是仅在认为有必要时才报告。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some'&gt;日本 GPIF 将介绍每项资产组合审查，而不仅仅是部分审查&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan GPIF to Brief on Every Asset-Mix Review, Not Just Some&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-gpif-to-brief-on-every-asset-mix-review-not-just-some</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:34:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</link><description>由于人工智能贸易的破裂和利率上升刺激了对避险资产的需求，美元有望实现两年来最长的月度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024'&gt;“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：‘Dollar Storm:’ Greenback on Track for Longest Winning Run Since 2024&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:44:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>